[{"title":"龙津小隐同郭王二光禄袁参藩邀集王宗伯宴饮和宗伯韵 其一","author":"陈堂","text":"卜筑江村里，龙津小有天。\n瓮头供酒漉，竹下枕书眠。\n客有携琴至，莺随带柳穿。\n怡然心共适，沉醉落花前。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":15510,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"龙津小隐同郭王二光禄袁参藩邀集王宗伯宴饮和宗伯韵 其二","author":"陈堂","text":"蓬蒿荒小径，疏病合幽栖。\n药裹床头满，厨烟竹里迷。\n绿含堤柳色，红绽野花蹊。\n胜会成欢赏，多君石上题。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":15511,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"龙津小隐同郭王二光禄袁参藩邀集王宗伯宴饮和宗伯韵 其三","author":"陈堂","text":"园林啼鸟倦，江海羡鸿冥。\n归兴情初洽，酣歌酒未停。\n帘垂新燕扑，笛奏有龙听。\n爱客欢何恨，厌厌夜不扃。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":15512,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"閒居忆昔年游西蜀 其一","author":"陈堂","text":"蜀道崚嶒险，苍茫半碧天。\n猿声长不断，雁字杳难传。\n百丈牵舆上，千盘绝壁悬。\n黄昏投宿处，孤枕伴啼鹃。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":15513,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"閒居忆昔年游西蜀 其二","author":"陈堂","text":"鸟道云逾湿，天低路转欹。\n惊蛇丰草动，骇马断桥危。\n树有青萝翳，阴无白日移。\n四时多雨色，旅客益凄其。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":15514,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"閒居忆昔年游西蜀 其三","author":"陈堂","text":"五月峨眉雪，孤根滟预堆。\n瞿塘翻浪下，赤甲自天来。\n绝域豺狼斗，阴崖魍魉猜。\n无因消旅思，聊以酌春醅。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":15515,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"閒居忆昔年游西蜀 其四","author":"陈堂","text":"昔年游蜀梦，此日遂初身。\n绛灌人何在，巢由自结邻。\n门堪罗鸟雀，酒可漉纶巾。\n回首风尘迹，甘为卧隐沦。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":15516,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题见一堂赠侯见洲藩伯","author":"陈堂","text":"功成疏宠位，兴洽在林塘。\n地拟青门胜，人欢绿野堂。\n卷帘邀月上，垂钓引杯长。\n清世冥鸿意，无劳问阮康。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":15517,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"泛舟过陈参军别业","author":"陈堂","text":"山城当睥睨，水上涌楼台。\n乳燕穿帘入，新筵逐浪开。\n花明青眼客，日落紫霞杯。\n兴剧娇歌发，无劳棹鼓催。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":15518,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过蒲涧和苏文忠韵","author":"陈堂","text":"采蒲乘逸兴，因过涧边泉。\n杯映霞为色，波摇水在天。\n荒台空有字，古刹不闻禅。\n酒尽青山暮，酣歌客亦仙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":15519,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"病起","author":"陈堂","text":"两月郊居便，凌晨病始瘳。\n已拚人共弃，惟与药相投。\n身外馀三径，床头隐百忧。\n何时可婚嫁，长与尚平游。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":15520,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送周少参入贺便道省觐祖母及二尊人","author":"陈堂","text":"使君拥传入熙朝，驷马因过万里桥。\n双阙望遥红日迥，太行家近白云遥。\n庭闱三寿南山老，金鉴千秋北斗杓。\n移孝为忠应自许，可谁攀附上青霄。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":15521,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"度庾岭谒张文献公祠","author":"陈堂","text":"百粤山川大庾开，车书玉帛自东来。\n谁将禹凿通尧域，故遣重关逼上台。\n一代勋劳天地老，千秋献纳古今才。\n差将薄劣瞻祠宇，不尽松风万壑哀。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":15522,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"望匡庐山","author":"陈堂","text":"匡庐万仞出芙蓉，犹似岧峣泰华峰。\n古刹有碑苍藓合，天池无路白云封。\n空闻缥缈仙踪远，岂为登临野兴慵。\n愿得他年禽庆约，扶筇采药日相从。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":15523,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游东林寺","author":"陈堂","text":"漫对匡庐紫翠中，幽栖聊与古人同。\n千年芳躅惟陶令，三笑何年是远公。\n池上白莲尘不染，坛边玉井净如空。\n虎溪莫种桃千树，恐有渔人路渐通。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":15524,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"道中闻三极殿火灾","author":"陈堂","text":"频年宫殿火为灾，万里孤臣首重回。\n罪己有言劳圣主，格天何日悟轮台。\n谁开榷府宏羊网，正忆和羹傅说梅。\n忧国杞人空有泪，东南民力可胜哀。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":15525,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送黄肖源宪副之滇南兼怀陈毓台中丞","author":"陈堂","text":"使君矫矫入滇南，万里褰帷拥驷骖。\n金马山城千叠嶂，昆明池水百花潭。\n去时杨柳逢春色，到日风霜扫夕岚。\n幕府过从如问讯，为言头白不胜簪。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":15526,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"云谷书院谒白沙先生祠","author":"陈堂","text":"嵂屼千盘石磴通，诸峰蓊郁白云丛。\n两崖泉响传空谷，万壑松涛度晚风。\n台上有碑封茂草，桥边流水断残虹。\n凭阑岂为悲秋色，仰止高山思不穷。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":15527,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"白云岩瀑布","author":"陈堂","text":"天开㠎嶪结层岩，岩瀑砰磅石削巉。\n坐上风雷通昼夜，尊前烟雨湿衣衫。\n银河倒落飞如练，白雪酣歌兴不凡。\n酒罢津头寻去棹，轻风摇飏送归帆。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":15528,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送袁宪副备兵贵竹","author":"陈堂","text":"王师十万独征西，借箸凭君静鼓鼙。\n剑划五溪山月小，寒生三尺暮云低。\n蛮夷魄夺旄头落，魍魉愁惊马首嘶。\n回望九重天阙近，拟将铭勒报金泥。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":15529,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋日顾直指招饮镇海楼","author":"陈堂","text":"飞楼百尺白云停，太史曾占有使星。\n柏院风清消暑气，香醪杯绿泛沧溟。\n屏开叠嶂芙蓉出，暮霭丛林罨画青。\n骢马到来山岳动，越裳何处不来庭。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":15530,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"百粤吟 其一","author":"陈堂","text":"粤王台上气萧萧，万木惊秋景寂寥。\n马首凭陵伤苜蓿，鹊巢栖断怨鸱鸮。\n笳声月落心如折，雁字风高影欲摇。\n野老临江空怅望，乘槎欲泛海边潮。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":15531,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"百粤吟 其二","author":"陈堂","text":"遥从南徼溯中原，玉帛车书统至尊。\n东去罗浮红日近，北瞻庾岭紫云屯。\n越裳重译周官在，横海楼船漠主恩。\n不分芙蓉秋亦老，物华凋敝可推论。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":15532,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"读蜀志","author":"陈堂","text":"空名误胁上楼船，五百遗金已尽捐。\n逆党罗才成网罟，蛾眉殃妒失英贤。\n孤臣岂意投荒裔，千古堪怜是谪仙。\n史有阙文谁为补，令人呜咽夜郎年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":15533,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闻播州报捷","author":"陈堂","text":"功成莫是欲心骄，媚子贪人满市朝。\n民瘼覆盆无白日，天威何处不商飙。\n伤弓惊鸟千林寂，涸辙枯鱼一水遥。\n共道关梁非上意，可堪狐鼠尽为妖。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":15534,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送何侍御出使三吴","author":"陈堂","text":"五花骢马下三吴，拥盖褰帷夹道呼。\n击隼霜横淩白日，射雕风急落平芜。\n简书尺一丝纶重，驿路皇华剑履趋。\n四海只今渔猎尽，凭君鸣凤在高梧。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":15535,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寿黄愚任明府八十一","author":"陈堂","text":"壮日风云忆共艭，雄心迟暮未曾降。\n百年交谊谁同调，一曲梅花祇共腔。\n仙箓新传青鸟使，吴侬旧识碧油幢。\n只今吏隐成霜鬓，岁岁惟应倒玉缸。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":15536,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"冬日访唐寅仲青门隐居","author":"陈堂","text":"薜萝为径竹为门，蓊郁纡回自一村。\n帘幕遥开千里色，烟霞晴绕万山攒。\n松涛风扫惊逾响，鸟雀寒深寂不喧。\n幽意独超尘世外，相看宾主共忘言。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":15537,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"人日晓起","author":"陈堂","text":"柳芽微露绿将匀，睡起东窗物色新。\n双蝶梦回身是客，七蓂开处日为人。\n门阑剪绿争谁胜，岭海晞旸总是春。\n跨马出郊时远眺，将因杯酒问花神。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":15538,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送袁大参之任海北","author":"陈堂","text":"匹马萧萧出海邦，轻裘缓带碧油幢。\n望悬合浦人千里，歌彻骊驹笛一腔。\n方岳诸侯谁是长，文章国士已无双。\n凭君保障消残垒，不必谈兵筑受降。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":15539,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"灵洲山","author":"陈堂","text":"迢迢郁水远中流，屹立孤峰起鹭洲。\n两岸烟村浮下界，几重云树隔危楼。\n渔歌夜度清霄月，僧罄时闻碧汉秋。\n白发归来吾亦老，好将卜筑借菟裘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":15540,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"白云山","author":"陈堂","text":"为问仙踪事有无，寻幽岩岫亦清都。\n台空不见千年鹤，涧冷犹存九节蒲。\n物外江山浮世界，云间丹灶乱蘼芜。\n无才正欲从仙隐，落日踟蹰听鹧鸪。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":15541,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"坡山","author":"陈堂","text":"五仙骑石化为羊，洞里烟霞出上方。\n地迥有天藏石室，云深何处觅丹房。\n鲸音缥缈惊寒梦，羽客逍遥入醉乡。\n炉篆千年应不灭，莫令轻作少年场。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":15542,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"樵山","author":"陈堂","text":"碧山古寺飞霞处，谁敞楼台袅薜萝。\n一径云深龙卧稳，两崖花落鸟声多。\n青天岚涌层层树，白昼风生滟滟波。\n笑倚危栏一回首，淡烟芳草思如何。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":15543,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"端阳杂咏 其一","author":"陈堂","text":"系臂相沿五色丝，浴兰采术亦何为。\n早知续命家家寿，何必山中茹紫芝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":15544,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"端阳杂咏 其二","author":"陈堂","text":"斗草同欢似戏场，含娇敛笑竞群芳。\n临风岂有梅花笛，吹落蛾眉点额妆。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":15545,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"端阳杂咏 其三","author":"陈堂","text":"疏柳鸣蜩缥缈闻，因思此日祀陈君。\n苍梧太守今何在，满目风尘扫白云。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":15546,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"端阳杂咏 其四","author":"陈堂","text":"遗俗相传蜥蜴空，岂因希宠日当熊。\n翻疑飞燕多相妒，故遣长门捕守宫。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":15547,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"端阳杂咏 其五","author":"陈堂","text":"能言鹦鹉事应非，鸲鹆那堪学语归。\n从此不需劳剪舌，恐令禽鸟解人机。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":15548,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"竞渡曲 其一","author":"陈堂","text":"一望飞凫斗水军，满天风雨隔江闻。\n雷声霹雳神鱼跃，化作双龙起夕曛。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":15549,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"竞渡曲 其二","author":"陈堂","text":"木兰舟渡采莲歌，粉黛娥眉奈乐何。\n水映杨花娇欲舞，尊前飞雪落清波。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":15550,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"竞渡曲 其三","author":"陈堂","text":"乘风破浪一身轻，红帕缠头耀日明。\n绿水清娇罗绮色，棹歌遥应管弦声。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":15551,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"阙题","author":"陈堂","text":"峡山寒影削飞来，璇玉潆洄古洞开。\n万叠芙蓉摇画幅，千秋霜雪锁楼台。\n临风几想流觞兴，招隐何人授简才。\n涤尽红尘应不染，移文休勒碧山隈。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":15552,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"谒李忠简公祠 其一","author":"陈大猷","text":"扁舟遥泛宝珠圆，柱砥中流别有天。\n万顷琉璃涵日月，千秋祠宇肃忠贤。\n先朝正气孤风凛，昭代崇恩奕世绵。\n赊望地围东去尽，日随征雁破苍烟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":15553,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"谒李忠简公祠 其二","author":"陈大猷","text":"垂绅端笏伟人哉，瞻拜人依钓艇来。\n千仞羽仪翔百粤，万年英气烛三台。\n酣听榜枻歌渔父，醒续离骚劣楚才。\n阅世瞰流心百折，沧桑何处不堪哀。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":15554,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"浮丘八景 其一 紫烟楼","author":"陈大猷","text":"一眺危楼倚碧空，山川形胜入鸿濛。\n远看漠漠烟云外，紫气长连八极中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":15555,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"浮丘八景 其二 晚沐堂","author":"陈大猷","text":"丹邱开辟郭西天，太史高名北斗悬。\n晚沐赐钱今日事，公馀应见主恩偏。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":15556,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"浮丘八景 其三 珊瑚井","author":"陈大猷","text":"珊瑚元产自遐荒，涓滴擎来玉作浆。\n脩炼旧曾闻此地，灵泉清彻拟沧浪。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":15557,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"浮丘八景 其四 大雅堂","author":"陈大猷","text":"翰苑名高执法台，华堂景胜若天开。\n群游白社瞻台斗，谁复翩翩倚马才。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":15558,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"浮丘八景 其五 留舄亭","author":"陈大猷","text":"缥缈仙真去不还，犹馀玉舄在人间。\n餐霞知有长生诀，目断蓬莱第一山。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":15559,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"浮丘八景 其六 朱明馆","author":"陈大猷","text":"炎荒东去有罗浮，门户朱明亦胜游。\n日月洞中饶紫气，丹台清绝此瀛洲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":15560,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"浮丘八景 其七 挹袖轩","author":"陈大猷","text":"高轩飞举兴多豪，学士仙风振雅骚。\n瑶岛拾来香满袖，相逢犹问旧宫袍。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":15561,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"浮丘八景 其八 听笙亭","author":"陈大猷","text":"孤亭仙侣许同群，子晋笙声海外闻。\n一自浮邱相遇后，缑山吹动九霄云。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":15562,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"叶午溪节推取道柳州适逢九日与诸同寅敬约小集","author":"陈大猷","text":"殊方令节醑筵张，秋气萧森透客裳。\n作赋自惭司马句，登台犹羡孟嘉狂。\n山凝紫气三江静，水落微霜万树黄。\n宴笑群公强健在，年年萸菊任徜徉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":15563,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"署中读陈贵峰山人赠言步韵","author":"陈大猷","text":"严程飞棹向西河，清夜还思白雪歌。\n彩笔新题占气象，高人幽兴寄烟萝。\n问奇深恨趋从少，引满尤怜意气多。\n更爱卢敖交谊重，论心天地聚羊何。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":15564,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"怀弟","author":"陈大猷","text":"初冬解缆忽匆匆，万里怀人两地同。\n久客渐疏姜被梦，长征犹恋白云东。\n夜残风雪驱羸马，岁杪关山断去鸿。\n聚首清宵知不远，玉河春色正青葱。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":15565,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送鸣志弟北上补选","author":"陈大猷","text":"三冬离思系浮槎，篱菊天边尽吐华。\n策马不迷庾岭路，驱车遥指帝王家。\n一杯共对珠江月，万里晴看碧海霞。\n驿路有人频折寄，愿闻清梦笔生花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":15566,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和陈明佐花朝韵并怀其弟明瞻","author":"陈大猷","text":"剧饮何须问酒帘，望来天角月纤纤。\n花朝暖入春容媚，柏叶浓分野兴添。\n布被夜增池草梦，葛巾时羡酒杯淹。\n苔痕十日无人破，飞絮繁花宿雨沾。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":15567,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"邀王省轩光禄入社","author":"陈大猷","text":"论文廿载共从容，制锦翩翩正气中。\n一自朝阳鸣瑞凤，于今湖海卧人龙。\n青山暂假勋卿傲，白雪应为艺苑宗。\n闻道仲宣多赋咏，西园负笈喜趋从。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":15568,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"厓门吊古","author":"陈大猷","text":"运去中华力不支，一时神器属胡儿。\n波涛怒激鼋鼍奋，风雨愁闻鼓角悲。\n灵驭九原随鹤化，忠魂千载翊龙飞。\n登临何限伤时泪，挥向厓山剔古碑。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":15569,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题樊隐君册","author":"徐尚典","text":"扁舟范蠡更谁如，大隐仙城近市居。\n海宇云山供笑傲，江湖踪迹混樵渔。\n烧丹未返华阳洞，扫径常过长者车。\n赢得高眠生圣世，传家不著茂陵书。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":15570,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"淮中寄怀姊丈粤桥何计部","author":"徐尚典","text":"宦海参商已十年，怜君龙卧稳林泉。\n含香每忆堪前席，煮海何如拥算鞭。\n世路一官牛马走，家山万里鹿蕉悬。\n相思欲拟归来赋，子舍汾阳簇玳筵。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":15571,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送金生新婚入太学","author":"徐尚典","text":"风流曾擅少年场，上苑骅骝逐电光。\n卺合凤箫环佩冷，席分羊石郁金香。\n漳河去去云烟渺，璧水迟迟日月长。\n得意看花消息近，泥金应寄陇头芳。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":15572,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题樊隐君册","author":"徐尚徽","text":"南阳高士重樊英，入粤扁舟为避名。\n休遣汉廷纁币至，江湖自分乐浮生。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":15573,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次郑司训写怀韵","author":"刘梦赐","text":"幽怀种种向谁论，发作狂歌白日昏。\n莫上庾公楼上望，天涯烟树易消魂。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":15574,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"小隐杂咏","author":"周笃棐","text":"莫笑枌榆栖，尘缘未了期。\n元珠收象罔，真慧破须弥。\n客至开棋局，情浓举酒卮。\n天韬终有解，八极驭云骑。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":15575,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"岩头石室","author":"周笃棐","text":"石室开峰上，山泉泻碧流。\n云深迷午径，斜日照松邱。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":15576,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"己亥仲夏游上杭南泉寺僧月修诵王阳明南征闲游寺诗因次韵","author":"杨泷","text":"司马南征甫偃戈，寻幽漫步入藤萝。\n坐看剑卖还耕犊，会见农忙理故蓑。\n闽壤烟消清永夜，粤江雨过涨新波。\n禅堂遗咏徵前古，老我长吟夕照多。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":15577,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}}]